    <briefdescription>
<para>Lock-free ring buffer for batching link commits. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Producers (link creators) append to buffer; consumer (background thread) batches commits. Allows amortizing commit overhead across multiple links. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
